{"doc_id": "D15", "subject": {"type": "Flight", "canonical": "flight:klm_flight_4805", "text": "KLM Flight 4805", "start": 307, "end": 322}, "relation": "INVOLVED_IN", "object": {"type": "Event", "canonical": "event:tenerife_airport_disaster", "text": "Tenerife airport disaster", "start": 0, "end": 25}, "evidence": {"text": "Tenerife airport disaster\n\nOn March 27, 1977, two Boeing 747 passenger jets collided on a runway at Los Rodeos Airport on the Spanish island of Tenerife, killing 583 people and injuring 61 others in the deadliest accident in aviation history. \nThe incident occurred at 17:06 GMT (UTC +0) in dense fog, when KLM Flight 4805 initiated its takeoff run, colliding with the right side of Pan Am Flight 1736, which was on the runway. The impact and the resulting fire killed all 248 people on board the KLM plane and 335 of the 396 people on board the Pan Am plane, with all 61 survivors being in the front section of the aircraft.", "start": 0, "end": 625}, "modality": "asserted", "annotator": "gemini", "evidence_verified": true, "provenance": {"method": "llm", "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "prompt_version": "B-v3", "doc_id": "D15", "run_id": "20261107T213738Z", "created": "2026-11-07T21:38:39+00:00", "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 42, "tokens_in": 2213, "tokens_out": 1570}}
{"doc_id": "D15", "subject": {"type": "Flight", "canonical": "flight:pan_am_flight_1736", "text": "Pan Am Flight 1736", "start": 383, "end": 401}, "relation": "INVOLVED_IN", "object": {"type": "Event", "canonical": "event:tenerife_airport_disaster", "text": "Tenerife airport disaster", "start": 0, "end": 25}, "evidence": {"text": "Tenerife airport disaster\n\nOn March 27, 1977, two Boeing 747 passenger jets collided on a runway at Los Rodeos Airport on the Spanish island of Tenerife, killing 583 people and injuring 61 others in the deadliest accident in aviation history. \nThe incident occurred at 17:06 GMT (UTC +0) in dense fog, when KLM Flight 4805 initiated its takeoff run, colliding with the right side of Pan Am Flight 1736, which was on the runway. The impact and the resulting fire killed all 248 people on board the KLM plane and 335 of the 396 people on board the Pan Am plane, with all 61 survivors being in the front section of the aircraft.", "start": 0, "end": 625}, "modality": "asserted", "annotator": "gemini", "evidence_verified": true, "provenance": {"method": "llm", "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "prompt_version": "B-v3", "doc_id": "D15", "run_id": "20261107T213738Z", "created": "2026-11-07T21:38:39+00:00", "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 42, "tokens_in": 2213, "tokens_out": 1570}}
{"doc_id": "D15", "subject": {"type": "AircraftType", "canonical": "aircrafttype:boeing_747", "text": "Boeing 747", "start": 50, "end": 60}, "relation": "MANUFACTURED_BY", "object": {"type": "Organization", "canonical": "organization:boeing", "text": "Boeing", "start": 50, "end": 56}, "evidence": {"text": "On March 27, 1977, two Boeing 747 passenger jets collided on a runway at Los Rodeos Airport on the Spanish island of Tenerife, killing 583 people and injuring 61 others in the deadliest accident in aviation history.", "start": 27, "end": 242}, "modality": "asserted", "annotator": "gemini", "evidence_verified": true, "provenance": {"method": "llm", "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "prompt_version": "B-v3", "doc_id": "D15", "run_id": "20261107T213738Z", "created": "2026-11-07T21:38:39+00:00", "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 42, "tokens_in": 2213, "tokens_out": 1570}}
{"doc_id": "D15", "subject": {"type": "Flight", "canonical": "flight:klm_flight_4805", "text": "KLM Flight 4805", "start": 2340, "end": 2355}, "relation": "SERVES", "object": {"type": "Airport", "canonical": "airport:gran_canaria_airport", "text": "Gran Canaria Airport", "start": 2208, "end": 2228}, "evidence": {"text": "Their destination was Gran Canaria Airport (also known as Las Palmas Airport or Gando Airport), serving Las Palmas on the nearby island of Gran Canaria.\n\nKLM Flight 4805\n\nKLM Flight 4805 was a charter flight for Holland International Travel Group and had arrived from Amsterdam Airport Schiphol, Netherlands.", "start": 2186, "end": 2494}, "modality": "asserted", "annotator": "gemini", "evidence_verified": true, "provenance": {"method": "llm", "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "prompt_version": "B-v3", "doc_id": "D15", "run_id": "20261107T213738Z", "created": "2026-11-07T21:38:39+00:00", "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 42, "tokens_in": 2213, "tokens_out": 1570}}
{"doc_id": "D15", "subject": {"type": "Flight", "canonical": "flight:klm_flight_4805", "text": "KLM Flight 4805", "start": 2357, "end": 2372}, "relation": "SERVES", "object": {"type": "Airport", "canonical": "airport:amsterdam_airport_schiphol", "text": "Amsterdam Airport Schiphol", "start": 2454, "end": 2480}, "evidence": {"text": "KLM Flight 4805 was a charter flight for Holland International Travel Group and had arrived from Amsterdam Airport Schiphol, Netherlands.", "start": 2357, "end": 2494}, "modality": "asserted", "annotator": "gemini", "evidence_verified": true, "provenance": {"method": "llm", "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "prompt_version": "B-v3", "doc_id": "D15", "run_id": "20261107T213738Z", "created": "2026-11-07T21:38:39+00:00", "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 42, "tokens_in": 2213, "tokens_out": 1570}}
{"doc_id": "D15", "subject": {"type": "Person", "canonical": "person:jacob_veldhuyzen_van_zanten", "text": "Jacob Veldhuyzen van Zanten", "start": 2533, "end": 2560}, "relation": "INVOLVED_IN", "object": {"type": "Flight", "canonical": "flight:klm_flight_4805", "text": "KLM Flight 4805", "start": 2357, "end": 2372}, "evidence": {"text": "KLM Flight 4805 was a charter flight for Holland International Travel Group and had arrived from Amsterdam Airport Schiphol, Netherlands. Its cockpit crew consisted of Captain Jacob Veldhuyzen van Zanten (age 50), First Officer Klaas Meurs (42), and Flight Engineer Willem Schreuder (48). At the time of the accident, Veldhuyzen van Zanten was KLM's chief flight instructor, with 11,700 flight hours, of which 1,545 hours were on the 747.", "start": 2357, "end": 2795}, "modality": "asserted", "annotator": "gemini", "evidence_verified": true, "provenance": {"method": "llm", "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "prompt_version": "B-v3", "doc_id": "D15", "run_id": "20261107T213738Z", "created": "2026-11-07T21:38:39+00:00", "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 42, "tokens_in": 2213, "tokens_out": 1570}, "qualifiers": {"role": "Captain"}}
